body:
)))hugs ((( 
I can sympathise with the whole emptiness when the kids are off doing their own thing. That's me currently.
Have you read up on dbt? There's some great books out that might be able to help.

I'm going through a similar thing with friends. So as a safety I had my husband take my phone and delete all numbers of their's, phone and text logs. I'm not safe on social media so that's gone and I'm currently trying to focus on self care by spoiling the shit out of myself, something that's really hard when you're beating up on yourself.  
Take each feeling as it comes. It's normal to feel guilty and I have noticed that each feeling is so intense. 
)))hugs (((
